      "why": "\"Complete additional courses from the School of Engineering's approved 2026-27 Math & Stats and/or Science course lists for 2026-27 to reach the 45 unit minimum of Math and Science coursework.\" The lists are not in this program's data; the student moves the courses in.",
      "patch": {
        "manual": "approval"
      }
    },
    "vNtm6aeG": {
