      "why": "\"At least 68 units of engineering science and design courses (Engineering Fundamentals, Depth, and Electives) must be completed ... For the remaining engineering elective units: Additional electives may be selected from the 7 focus areas listed in the Depth in Discipline section, or from the following.\" The 68 is the group floor, not this list's; electives count only as needed to reach it. \"Up to 4 units of CEE 199/199L may be used in this category.\" Unlisted courses approved by petition are moved in by hand.",
